> > > > > > > > > > However, I get strange results for the correlation matrix of the spatial
> > > > > > > > > > effects, e.g. the correlation between the 1st and 3rd BYM field results
> > > > > > > > > > about -0.92 in mean. This does not appear consistent with the data
