> > > > > > > > > > > Dear INLA experts
> > > > > > > > > > >
> > > > > > > > > > > I am fitting an M-model extension to the BYM model,
> > > > > > > > > > > roughly based on the
> > > > > > > > > > > paper by Urdangarin et al., 2024.
